-- CAPABILITY ---------------- errors/cap_ceiling_4.march

`main` performs IO but declares no grant. The program reaches `IO.Mut`; a `main` with no capability parameter is granted nothing. [cap_grant]
help: declare the grant `main` actually needs —
        fn main(_cap_mut : Cap(IO.Mut)) : ()
or grant everything with `fn main(cap : Cap(IO))`.
`forge fix` can apply this.

21 |   fn main() do
       ^^^^^^^^^^^^


    fix (`forge fix` applies it):

21 -   fn main() do
21 +   fn main(_cap_mut : Cap(IO.Mut)) do

    run `march --explain cap_grant`



